{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/70a1a1349cd5cbf879dd86416cda2cd03bbbc099bae106f843f75a81beaf372b42ed5dd5f0609088e6bd048dfa1d319b98cb05de59e35245ed35ee53593d966743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/165fe004506914b9fa1b276b07d5e915eacfbd0b32f2af4c823b23afebb137d810b0a2bdf1a82cd264b0e7b8c86adfe4862b14d26e772eee28da689a7462af3fe3b2552f0123efa2365427265d3da5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b6850804acd82569dafe7df40e8bec3be48c420bc976e0d1cf88789e32b6742a25dde5ec865f189901702b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c7fafca81a7829775722b5d0aea893fd8519fc0737562832f6f80d4576b1b0f37a3c669cefe72202b2766332c5310c8e618a2b1f12d2335dd910115fcd531cabecb5ccfb1cefa83287142cb7fccd95\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a1bfc0ddebec4fdf0bf044df8c1be895137a41260907bde1f218c83e206897b1cfb5da7cf9669a44ab1dca6b78527220d9554592745edad46507b192a812186bd0702450a3b1271a0407bebf084d3a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5b964724c5e165407522ad93f79dd7823e2fa8e7e73ed9677bebe5f9f840af4b184fa4c5e47cebd9d3ad38c58972021ce7ef7599a20cdd6dbcacf9f0af8ea66f3fecc15c7b9d442159ac8d88489498\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/17b8ab06434c5951a0361928d48a4d37328036acbc3dc33156d30999114353afa785be3ceae76720a5a2c99d19f524f82889e0c9ffea3bb1900cb591b68be78c40f6a7aa8efa55a984a2eeb234db7d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c7f97cc0b5ae534cac5c11f1eacbace0a58d9c8e9d8d9025b66e6172e17eca06506ee89af00d01cffdfa18acbfbf279e58b5d12d1ba156ef01fcefdb00f4b71e69454ca42ba3fcc35a45e02bfcb078\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/242f447073b7fb36b14ae3e8a2501f2e163a6536de29a65fe1a8ddabcd273b5736b597ae58b563fb32f92b0e5a065f7032b16bef68602c3dfcaf29eb20623894bf05742b034d071801dcac358c0880\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/77d68df8953a47d7d551feb429ce5b792dd0defe9be1194e61f24cb9ce624689f2bcb3f1306e962c79860de1c419ffecff48fe9cbda7a4301830d41d5432df87549e67ac537c3444c274e1f86dc769\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e119c65de0755350934b4b306279cdfb884adee43913da14628984e5a88938249422676bed2854f0713000869f76affb188c29f0213efcd612e6453e9e8b736d789667412faf21d6f08f73114049af\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4711970911e07b2465daf67a6d4e56f06e494a98fc83c605ae996f4085272c6883d236cf0273fb86db1298dfb092d8a6b3ac27622dedbe6d52eacb0991586cce649058e09775789863299af9969c8e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/417e24c3e35bc084c947912f74c219d5762efc7d75633b2e72159381e55fc956cc9ec6e6f63de8be30984a949d84b8feecd9faae67ab0e0d03eac7b69b46de611df044876a01724a1399469e4faea4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/16f9b876cc2fe3ab2855789cc665a7819ea55d835962c1133d609e4ed7c6189bc1723221444bb82b6ca7bd921e14dc305ede691fdf4586aa6f003e4bcf769c30bd2ba6ba8794d9d7bcb0b9e1686096\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c5d7d7d33bc414e1ca9a4212fc6b682668f400848ec79c26e39fa7eabf97ce236fc1afe25d0b40922877103661caa77eb366b1ee9a3bfed9689c9dd50a9cecfe6141504125bc9abdada1b1cd69964d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/72023e492f179f9ba5d4ec2696e10772a3f857f9a1f405e495c6b828d030bb9a84ab49b57710e28fa5f39410d00dd4d3a2bb44f7c912ca91d4d7f1126d8dd4f5db3537f531bb7926413f3a19f9e2ab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/179e56d7ba5cc3ce9c0a8f58955f13dbd2b8f26512e14a8d9013448ce001c128f27afab768a8195b3174abe3b7b9c4d277d2416b911d2054e6dbed0be9e4cc502c777019bb563678553b57a914301e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a2e425556a43bcf9a120fb9232310a4bc88713c349429ff3c7a890f8204dc4df0c1b74ac48af2900e70dc77d3c666c9fecd374c905c72b34d6e4ed242d4c5ed48a98c31034db46cc49cfaea47cf2ed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/76cd3e34681fe600ae3f8678192ee583a1b37728f19529bdc4fddf48d176d382aebbd529012b245ea793e6a78734e8bc0663d79fb09af7b4a92aa303a488b84cc33368aa6bbb8ccb6900638d6d12d8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bd95788aa05b0d121c83e27fc33b9f0c0f57692543a7c929c92899081af47fb8610bfcdf615de9b63a57667c917ca808a950b02321c04ee22ceabff062ac3b9404a633c6d3b2344edd3c8fe652656f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
